{"id": "2244", "title": "卞之琳文集", "author": "卞之琳", "category": "文学名著", "count": 32, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/2/2244.htm", "intro": "卞之琳（1910-2000），祖籍江苏溧水，生於江苏海门汤家镇。近代诗人、学者。曾任北京大学西语系教授(1949-1952)，中社科院文学所研究员(二级)享受终身制待遇；曾任国务院学位委员会第一、二届外国文学评议组成员；中国莎士比亚研究会副会长；历任中国作家协会理事，现任顾问；曾作客英国牛津(1947-1949)。抗日战争初年曾访问延安从事临时性教学工作、并访问太行山区前方、随军；回西南大後方後在昆明西南联大，任讲师，副教授，定级教授，1946复员至天津南开大学任职一年。", "base": "files/article/html/2/2244", "chapters": [{"title": "长治马路宽", "file": "230937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "离合记缘", "file": "230986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "淘气", "file": "231002.html", "available": false}, {"title": "断章", "file": "231035.html", "available": false}, {"title": "投", "file": "231053.html", "available": false}, {"title": "墙头草", "file": "231072.html", "available": false}, {"title": "雨同我", "file": "231090.html", "available": false}, {"title": "尺八", "file": "231108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "寂寞", "file": "231145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "圆宝盒", "file": "231178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "音尘", "file": "231224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "距离的组织", "file": "231269.html", "available": false}, {"title": "旧元夜遐思", "file": "231296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "鱼化石", "file": "231364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "半岛", "file": "231442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "隔江泪", "file": "231553.html", "available": false}, {"title": "灯虫", "file": "231657.html", "available": false}, {"title": "妆台", "file": "231746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "白螺壳", "file": "231851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "无题（一）", "file": "231920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "无题（二）", "file": "231932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "无题（三）", "file": "232096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "无题（四）", "file": "232124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "无题（五）", "file": "232151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大车", "file": "232174.html", "available": fals